# P74 on WSL GtkBackend: ported 2026-10-20 from actions/win/P74-choose-in-every-style.actions; the steps and pass condition are the Windows file's, quoted below. Positions from the AT-SPI dump under WSLg (x11), client coordinates, origin empty; a control named in a row's note was looked up by that name.
# P74(WSL):由 actions/win/P74-choose-in-every-style.actions 移植(2026-10-20),步驟與通過條件同下方 Windows 原文；座標取自 WSLg 下的 AT-SPI,為 client 座標。
# P74 on Windows: choose a value in every picker style, each by real input.
# Written 2026-10-08. Positions are UIA centres minus the window's GetWindowRect
# origin, WinUIBackend, 100% scale, window 536x799.
# Pass: "menu -> Cherry", "segmented -> Three", "radioGroup -> Blue",
# Re-aimed 2026-10-21 from a capture: since GtkBackend draws in Segoe UI under WSL (8f0fcad6) the rows below the segmented control sit about 16 px lower, so the measured y 299 and 452 hit Green and Wed; Blue (101,315), Thu (116,472), the disabled Green (114,595).
# "wheel -> Thu" -- and still "radioGroup -> Blue" after the press on the
# DISABLED group's Green, which must be refused.
# P74's window was 520x620 until 2026-10-08; at that height only the disabled
# group's first row was inside the window and Green could not be pressed. It is
# now 520x760 (content sits in a top-aligned ScrollView, so the macOS file's
# coordinates do not move).
# P74(Windows):在每一種 picker 樣式中各以真實輸入選一個值。2026-10-08 撰寫。座標為 UIA 中心減去視窗
# GetWindowRect 原點,WinUIBackend,100% 縮放，視窗 536x799。通過:"menu -> Cherry"、"segmented -> Three"、
# "radioGroup -> Blue"、"wheel -> Thu",且按下**停用**群組的 Green 之後仍是 "radioGroup -> Blue"。
# P74 視窗在 2026-10-08 之前是 520x620,那個高度下停用群組只有第一列在視窗內，按不到 Green;現在是 520x760
# (內容位於靠上對齊的 ScrollView 中，因此 macOS 那份檔案的座標不受影響)。
sleep,,,,,,1500000,let P74 lay out,gtk
click,113,116,,left,,,open the menu picker (shows Apple),gtk
sleep,,,,,,800000,let the drop-down open,gtk
key,,,,,downArrow,,Apple -> Banana,gtk
sleep,,,,,,200000,,gtk
key,,,,,downArrow,,Banana -> Cherry,gtk
sleep,,,,,,200000,,gtk
key,,,,,return,,choose -- the label must read menu -> Cherry,gtk
sleep,,,,,,800000,let the drop-down close,gtk
click,247,186,,left,,,segmented: Three,gtk
sleep,,,,,,500000,,gtk
click,101,315,,left,,,radioGroup: Blue,gtk
sleep,,,,,,500000,,gtk
click,116,472,,left,,,wheel: Thu,gtk
sleep,,,,,,500000,,gtk
click,114,595,,left,,,the DISABLED group's Green -- must be refused: radioGroup must still read Blue,gtk
sleep,,,,,,20000000,hold 20s so the final capture lands while the window is up,gtk
